comments.message:
Instead of these (#614 to 632) you can write like below...

${current_autoconfig_state}=  Get Text  ${xpath_eth0_ipv6_autoconfig_button}

IF  '${eth0autonfig_state}' == '${current_autoconfig_state}'
      # When autoconfig state is already set to the given value, click ipv6autoconfig toggle
      # button twice to reset value back to its original value.
      Click Element  ${xpath_eth0_ipv6_autoconfig_button}
      Click Element   ${xpath_eth0_ipv6_autoconfig_button}
      Element Text Should Be   ${xpath_eth0_ipv6_autoconfig_button} ${eth0autonfig_state}
ELSE IF  '${eth0autonfig_state}' != '${current_autoconfig_state}'
      Click Element  ${xpath_eth0_ipv6_autoconfig_button}
      Element Text Should Be  ${xpath_eth0_ipv6_autoconfig_button} ${eth0autonfig_state}
END

Check if possible to verify the SLAAC address, something like this.

@{ipv6_addressorigin_list}  ${ipv6_slaac_addr}=  Get Address Origin List And Address For Type  SLAAC

Page Should Contain  ${ipv6_slaac_addr}
